{"id":"2f5dec406c92aa2e","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-profinite.md","title":"Profinite Algebra","display":"df-profinite — Profinite Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-profinite","aliases":["93-df-profinite"],"display":"df-profinite — Profinite Algebra","depends_on":["[[93-df-inverse-limit]]","[[93-df-product]]","[[93-df-finite-algebra]]","[[93-df-homomorphism]]","[[93-df-isomorphism]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-profinite"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-profinite</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-profinite — Profinite Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"87bee95cbaea0934\" href=\"?note=87bee95cbaea0934\" title=\"93-df-inverse-limit\">93-df-inverse-limit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"260c377f5e1dcfdf\" href=\"?note=260c377f5e1dcfdf\" title=\"93-df-product\">93-df-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"32c4e6b205cc3cd8\" href=\"?note=32c4e6b205cc3cd8\" title=\"93-df-finite-algebra\">93-df-finite-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fe06c83d404633c2\" href=\"?note=fe06c83d404633c2\" title=\"93-df-isomorphism\">93-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span> is fixed and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb A=\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbb A=\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle\\)</span> pairs a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>-algebra with a topology on its carrier.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B^{\\times m}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T)\">\\(\\mathcal B^{\\times m}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T^{\\times m}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T)\">\\(\\mathcal T^{\\times m}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T)\\)</span> are the explicitly constructed finite-product base and topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^m\">\\(A^m\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InvLim}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{InvLim}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\)</span> have their source signatures; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}_{X}\">\\(\\mathrm{id}_{X}\\)</span> denotes the identity graph on the displayed set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BondDom}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{BondDom}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InvLim}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{InvLim}_{93}\\)</span> have their explicit source signatures.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Haus}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Haus}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cont}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cont}_{93}\\)</span>, the finite-product topology, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TopAlg}_{93,\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{TopAlg}_{93,\\tau}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TopIso}_{93,\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{TopIso}_{93,\\tau}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Box}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Box}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B^{\\Pi}_{93}\">\\(\\mathcal B^{\\Pi}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T^{\\Pi}_{93}\">\\(\\mathcal T^{\\Pi}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T^{\\mathrm{lim}}_{93}\">\\(\\mathcal T^{\\mathrm{lim}}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Profinite}_{93}(-;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Profinite}_{93}(-;\\tau)\\)</span> are defined here; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lim}\">\\(\\mathrm{lim}\\)</span> is a mnemonic topology tag.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite}\\vdash\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\\land\\varnothing\\in\\mathcal T\\land A\\in\\mathcal T\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal T\\;(\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal T)\\land\\forall U,V\\in\\mathcal T\\;(U\\cap V\\in\\mathcal T),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Haus}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(a\\neq b\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\mathcal T\\;(a\\in U\\land b\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cont}_{93}(g;A,\\mathcal T_A,B,\\mathcal T_B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T_A,A)\\land\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T_B,B)\n\\land g:A\\to B\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal T_B\\;(g^{-1}[U]\\in\\mathcal T_A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite}\\vdash\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\\land\\varnothing\\in\\mathcal T\\land A\\in\\mathcal T\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal T\\;(\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal T)\\land\\forall U,V\\in\\mathcal T\\;(U\\cap V\\in\\mathcal T),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Haus}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\n\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;(a\\neq b\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\mathcal T\\;(a\\in U\\land b\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cont}_{93}(g;A,\\mathcal T_A,B,\\mathcal T_B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T_A,A)\\land\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T_B,B)\n\\land g:A\\to B\\land\\forall U\\in\\mathcal T_B\\;(g^{-1}[U]\\in\\mathcal T_A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite}\\vdash\n\\mathcal B^{\\times m}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\prod_{i&lt;m}\\mathbf U(i):\\mathbf U\\in\\mathcal T^m\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal T^{\\times m}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal U:\\mathcal U\\subseteq\n\\mathcal B^{\\times m}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T)\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\\land m\\in\\omega\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T^{\\times m}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T),A^m).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite}\\vdash\n\\mathcal B^{\\times m}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\prod_{i&lt;m}\\mathbf U(i):\\mathbf U\\in\\mathcal T^m\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal T^{\\times m}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal U:\\mathcal U\\subseteq\n\\mathcal B^{\\times m}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T)\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T,A)\\land m\\in\\omega\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T^{\\times m}_{93}(A,\\mathcal T),A^m).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite}\\vdash\\mathrm{TopAlg}_{93,\\tau}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T_A,|\\mathbf A|)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\;\\mathrm{Cont}_{93}\n(f^{\\mathbf A};|\\mathbf A|^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)},\n\\mathcal T^{\\times\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}_{93}(|\\mathbf A|,\\mathcal T_A),\n|\\mathbf A|,\\mathcal T_A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{TopIso}_{93,\\tau}(h;\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle,\\langle\\mathbf B,\\mathcal T_B\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{TopAlg}_{93,\\tau}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{TopAlg}_{93,\\tau}(\\langle\\mathbf B,\\mathcal T_B\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cont}_{93}(h;|\\mathbf A|,\\mathcal T_A,|\\mathbf B|,\\mathcal T_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Cont}_{93}(h^{-1};|\\mathbf B|,\\mathcal T_B,|\\mathbf A|,\\mathcal T_A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite}\\vdash\\mathrm{TopAlg}_{93,\\tau}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{Top}_{93}(\\mathcal T_A,|\\mathbf A|)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\;\\mathrm{Cont}_{93}\n(f^{\\mathbf A};|\\mathbf A|^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)},\n\\mathcal T^{\\times\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}_{93}(|\\mathbf A|,\\mathcal T_A),\n|\\mathbf A|,\\mathcal T_A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{TopIso}_{93,\\tau}(h;\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle,\\langle\\mathbf B,\\mathcal T_B\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{TopAlg}_{93,\\tau}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{TopAlg}_{93,\\tau}(\\langle\\mathbf B,\\mathcal T_B\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cont}_{93}(h;|\\mathbf A|,\\mathcal T_A,|\\mathbf B|,\\mathcal T_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Cont}_{93}(h^{-1};|\\mathbf B|,\\mathcal T_B,|\\mathbf A|,\\mathcal T_A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Box}_{93}(\\mathbf U;\\mathbf A,I)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{a\\in\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I):\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(a(i)\\in\\mathbf U(i))\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal B^{\\Pi}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf T;I)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\left\\{\\operatorname{Box}_{93}(\\mathbf U;\\mathbf A,I):\n\\mathbf U\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathbf T(i)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\bigl(\\{i\\in I:\\mathbf U(i)\\neq|\\mathbf A(i)|\\}\\bigr)\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal T^{\\Pi}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf T;I)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\left\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal U:\\mathcal U\\subseteq\n\\mathcal B^{\\Pi}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf T;I)\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal T^{\\mathrm{lim}}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf p;I,R,\\tau)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\left\\{\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R)\\cap U:\nU\\in\\mathcal T^{\\Pi}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf T;I)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Box}_{93}(\\mathbf U;\\mathbf A,I)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{a\\in\\operatorname{ProdCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I):\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(a(i)\\in\\mathbf U(i))\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal B^{\\Pi}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf T;I)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\left\\{\\operatorname{Box}_{93}(\\mathbf U;\\mathbf A,I):\n\\mathbf U\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}\\mathbf T(i)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\bigl(\\{i\\in I:\\mathbf U(i)\\neq|\\mathbf A(i)|\\}\\bigr)\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal T^{\\Pi}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf T;I)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\left\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal U:\\mathcal U\\subseteq\n\\mathcal B^{\\Pi}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf T;I)\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal T^{\\mathrm{lim}}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf p;I,R,\\tau)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\left\\{\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf p;I,R)\\cap U:\nU\\in\\mathcal T^{\\Pi}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf T;I)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite}\\vdash\\mathrm{Profinite}_{93}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{TopAlg}_{93,\\tau}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{Haus}_{93}(\\mathcal T_A,|\\mathbf A|)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists I\\;\\exists R\\;\\exists\\mathbf D\\;\\exists\\mathbf T\\;\\exists\\mathbf p\\;\\Bigl[\nI\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land R\\subseteq I^2\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\langle i,i\\rangle\\in R)\n\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,i\\rangle\\in R\\to i=j)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\exists k\\in I\\;(\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathbf D:I\\to V\\land\\mathbf T:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathbf p:\\operatorname{BondDom}_{93}(I,R)\\to V\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf D(i))\\land\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf D(i))\n\\land\\mathbf T(i)=\\mathcal P(|\\mathbf D(i)|)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\to\n\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(\\mathbf p(\\langle i,j\\rangle),\\mathbf D(j),\\mathbf D(i))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\mathbf p(\\langle i,i\\rangle)=\\mathrm{id}_{|\\mathbf D(i)|}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R\\to\n\\mathbf p(\\langle i,k\\rangle)=\\mathbf p(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\\circ\\mathbf p(\\langle j,k\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}(\\mathbf D,\\mathbf p;I,R)\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists h\\;\\mathrm{TopIso}_{93,\\tau}\\Bigl(\nh;\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle,\n\\bigl\\langle\\mathrm{InvLim}_{93}(\\mathbf D,\\mathbf p;I,R,\\tau),\n\\mathcal T^{\\mathrm{lim}}_{93}(\\mathbf D,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf p;I,R,\\tau)\\bigr\\rangle\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr],\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}profinite}\\vdash\\mathrm{Profinite}_{93}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{TopAlg}_{93,\\tau}(\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{Haus}_{93}(\\mathcal T_A,|\\mathbf A|)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists I\\;\\exists R\\;\\exists\\mathbf D\\;\\exists\\mathbf T\\;\\exists\\mathbf p\\;\\Bigl[\nI\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\\land R\\subseteq I^2\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\langle i,i\\rangle\\in R)\n\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,i\\rangle\\in R\\to i=j)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\exists k\\in I\\;(\\langle i,k\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathbf D:I\\to V\\land\\mathbf T:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathbf p:\\operatorname{BondDom}_{93}(I,R)\\to V\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf D(i))\\land\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf D(i))\n\\land\\mathbf T(i)=\\mathcal P(|\\mathbf D(i)|)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\to\n\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(\\mathbf p(\\langle i,j\\rangle),\\mathbf D(j),\\mathbf D(i))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\mathbf p(\\langle i,i\\rangle)=\\mathrm{id}_{|\\mathbf D(i)|}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle j,k\\rangle\\in R\\to\n\\mathbf p(\\langle i,k\\rangle)=\\mathbf p(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\\circ\\mathbf p(\\langle j,k\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{InvCar}_{93}(\\mathbf D,\\mathbf p;I,R)\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists h\\;\\mathrm{TopIso}_{93,\\tau}\\Bigl(\nh;\\langle\\mathbf A,\\mathcal T_A\\rangle,\n\\bigl\\langle\\mathrm{InvLim}_{93}(\\mathbf D,\\mathbf p;I,R,\\tau),\n\\mathcal T^{\\mathrm{lim}}_{93}(\\mathbf D,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf p;I,R,\\tau)\\bigr\\rangle\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr],\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The signature is an explicit argument of profiniteness, and continuity quantifies over the symbols and arities projected from that argument. Product boxes, topology families, the directed relation, the algebra family, and the bonding family are genuine set-theoretic functions or relations rather than free indexed metanotation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-inverse-limit","s